{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeth Cutter is a collection of short horror stories. Each scenario is trying to deliver you something terrifying.\u00a0 Experience multiple distinct horror scenarios, each lasting from a few minutes to half an hour.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>THE HORROR THAT AWAITS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Intruder</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man comes home from work to find that someone is in his house. What will he do to this heinous intruder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Father Martin Is Missing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a private investigator looking for a lost father of a newly constructed church. Read his notes and investigate the area to find out what happened to him. Hear the sounds of God's breath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Terminal</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cop uses a new piece of technology to scan a memory of a crime. Figure out what happened in this <i>bizarre</i> murder suicide.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/fb81ca0088c2258084d9aa6f7056d528.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/fb81ca0088c2258084d9aa6f7056d528.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/fb81ca0088c2258084d9aa6f7056d528.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Normal Fishing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lake made of blood, fish that whisper, setting fire for an ancient god? All in all just another normal day of fishing on the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/f7e84ebaebd33fc114fce334137ac501.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/f7e84ebaebd33fc114fce334137ac501.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/f7e84ebaebd33fc114fce334137ac501.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Supply Run</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When scientists discover objects whose carbon dating are older than any known object, you work as a man who carries supplies to those scientists. You encounter an issue when a snow storm obscures all vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/1cbba44095a1738eeee65be89c2799a8.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/1cbba44095a1738eeee65be89c2799a8.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/1cbba44095a1738eeee65be89c2799a8.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Odd Date</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After eating too many tacos, your date is ruined by an IBS attack (the true horror). You then find out that the person you are dating is a little odd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/2b4347c4a0fb1223491f1c259a6f1cf8.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/2b4347c4a0fb1223491f1c259a6f1cf8.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/2b4347c4a0fb1223491f1c259a6f1cf8.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Factory</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work a blue collar job while trying to keep your spouse and child housed and happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/473019fe946c09f35192d43d757b22cc.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/473019fe946c09f35192d43d757b22cc.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/473019fe946c09f35192d43d757b22cc.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Hangerval, Indiana</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your true love has died, you find a spell to bring them back to life. How far would you go for the one you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/0f2d7e14ffaa9ea2e8de96b5a69ba9aa.poster.avif?t=1774664809\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/0f2d7e14ffaa9ea2e8de96b5a69ba9aa.webm?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/0f2d7e14ffaa9ea2e8de96b5a69ba9aa.mp4?t=1774664809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125490?t=1774664809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125490?t=1774664809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/216216bb1f019e94a357ffd00162e082130338ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774664809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/216216bb1f019e94a357ffd00162e082130338ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774664809","categories":[{"description":"